---
// src/components/Projects.astro
// “Projects” section, rewritten so that all images live in a fixed 16:9 box
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-foreground w-full max-w-screen-2xl text-center flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-10 px-4 py-24 sm:py-24 select-none"
>
  <h2
    class="z-10 w-full max-w-xl sm:text-center text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-pretty bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-b from-background via-background to-muted-foreground"
  >
    Every family deserves a real, accessible AAC solution.
  </h2>
  <p
    class="w-full max-w-xl bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-b from-background via-background to-muted-foreground sm:text-center text-normal sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-light tracking-tighter text-balance"
  >
    No sales pressure. No markup. Just support, honesty and real choice.
  </p>

  <div class="z-10 w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 grid-rows-6 gap-4">
    <!-- ============================
         1) 主设备和配件展示 (占 3 列 × 2 行)
         ============================ -->
    <article
      class="overflow-hidden relative bg-dark-card col-span-1 md:col-span-3 md:row-span-2 border h-[300px] border-dark-border rounded-[1rem] flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:gap-4"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full items-start p-4 text-left">
        <h3
          class="text-left sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-pretty bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-background via-background to-secondary"
        >
          The AAC For All Device Kit
        </h3>
        <p
          class="w-full text-muted-foreground text-left text-sm sm:text-normal md:text-lg font-light tracking-tighter text-balance"
        >
          Rugged Samsung Galaxy Tab Active 3 tablet, new shockproof case (with
          hand/shoulder straps), and pre-installed screen protector.  
          <br /><br />
          Suited for non-speaking or autistic children — durable, portable,
          ready for real-life use at home, school, or in the community.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 16:9 固定比例容器 -->
      <div class="aspect-video flex-shrink-0 w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <img
          src="/assets/aac-1.jpg"
          alt="Tablet and case"
          loading="lazy"
          class="object-cover w-full h-full rounded-md"
        />
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================
         2) 真实应用与 App 截图 (占 2 列 × 2 行)
         ============================ -->
    <article
      class="overflow-hidden group bg-dark-card col-span-1 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 md:col-start-4 h-[300px] border border-dark-border rounded-[1rem] p-4 flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-2"
    >
      <div
        class="w-fit rounded-full bg-background px-4 py-2 flex justify-center items-center rotate-12 group-hover:rotate-0 border transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <span class="text-normal sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-light tracking-tighter">
          Free open-source AAC apps
        </span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="w-fit rounded-full bg-background px-4 py-2 flex justify-center items-center -rotate-6 group-hover:rotate-0 border transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <span class="text-normal sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-light tracking-tighter">
          No Google account required
        </span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="w-fit rounded-full bg-background px-4 py-2 flex justify-center items-center border"
      >
        <span class="text-normal sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-light tracking-tighter">
          Instant trial, full refund
        </span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="w-fit rounded-full bg-background px-4 py-2 flex justify-center items-center border rotate-12 group-hover:rotate-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <span class="text-normal sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-light tracking-tighter">
          Companion Card supported
        </span>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================
         3) App 实际截图 (占 2 列 × 2 行)
         这里将两张图各放入 16:9 容器，垂直堆叠
         ============================ -->
    <article
      class="overflow-hidden bg-dark-card col-span-1 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 md:row-start-3 border h-auto border-dark-border rounded-[1rem] p-4"
    >
      <!-- 这里我们改为一个竖直排列的 Grid，每个子项都是 16:9 -->
      <div class="grid grid-rows-2 gap-4 h-full">
        <!-- 第一张截图 -->
        <div class="aspect-video w-full">
          <img
            src="/assets/aac-2.jpg"
            alt="AAC app running"
            loading="lazy"
            class="object-cover w-full h-full rounded-md"
          />
        </div>
        <!-- 第二张截图 -->
        <div class="aspect-video w-full">
          <img
            src="/assets/aac-3.png"
            alt="Tablet with accessories"
            loading="lazy"
            class="object-cover w-full h-full rounded-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================
         4) 价格/试用政策/家长承诺 (占 3 列 × 2 行)
         ============================ -->
    <article
      class="overflow-hidden bg-dark-card col-span-1 md:col-span-3 md:row-span-2 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-3 border h-[300px] border-dark-border rounded-[1rem] flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:gap-4"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full items-start p-4 text-left">
        <h3
          class="text-left sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-pretty bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-background via-background to-secondary"
        >
          Fair, transparent, parent-driven
        </h3>
        <p
          class="w-full text-muted-foreground text-left text-sm sm:text-normal md:text-lg font-light tracking-tighter text-balance"
        >
          Each set is offered at cost: $110 (with valid Companion Card).
          <br /><br />
          <b
            >Try for 2 weeks — if it's not the right fit, just return for a full
            refund. No questions asked.</b
          >
          <br />
          This is about support, not sales.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="aspect-video flex-shrink-0 w-full lg:w-1/2">
        <img
          src="/assets/aac-4.jpg"
          alt="Protective case set"
          loading="lazy"
          class="object-cover w-full h-full rounded-md"
        />
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================
         5) 联系方式和真实承诺 (占 2 列 × 2 行)
         ============================ -->
    <article
      class="overflow-hidden bg-dark-card col-span-1 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 md:col-start-4 md:row-start-5 border h-[300px] border-dark-border rounded-[1rem]"
    >
      <div class="w-full h-full flex flex-col gap-5 justify-center items-center">
        <h1
          class="sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-pretty bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-background via-background to-secondary"
        >
          Questions? Contact me
        </h1>
        <a
          href="mailto:helloluna520@gmail.com"
          class="w-fit flex gap-2 justify-center items-center px-4 py-2 sm:text-lg font-medium text-background bg-primary rounded-full"
        >
          Email for support
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <!-- 背景虚化圆形 -->
  <div
    class="bg-white opacity-10 absolute w-80 h-80 top-[-160px] border blur-[150px] rounded-full"
  ></div>
</section>

<style>
  /* 如果以后用到“垂直滚动文字”之类的动画，可放这里 */
</style>
